Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.28,0:00:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through\Nthe wind and make a stand The
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.30,0:00:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,paint within brings out a map of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,your own To the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,left and the right,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,all we saw stormy nights All the rough\Nwinds and waves coming day after day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had were about to\Ncollapse Oh just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,cut through the wind and make A stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,don't let the darkness\Nwin, just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone,\Nwe'll go where we all want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.22,0:02:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I blocked that, but\Nhis Thunder Bagua was too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a long way\Nto go. Yama, bro could
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.28,0:02:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you help that oversized coward over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait did you just call me a coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn right I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.10,0:02:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shut up get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough be patient I'm not a\Nfool I know it must be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't summon my courage\Nin an instant I need time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry. I'll back\Nyou up. We'll do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:03:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I left before\Nthat won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay now let's stop
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.90,0:03:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigashima do your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,best you too hey
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get back here, I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I must!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight him alone, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can grab the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragons can create clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never done such a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a great and powerful dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying is like second nature to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have complete faith in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dragon. Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you have the power...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,to create clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Ward Momonosuke and run away! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragons don't fly like a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They create clouds and grab onto them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They run through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of power you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A fire in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We call them fling clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop here for a second. See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Kaido planned for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ponikashima is falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a bad sign, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like his power\Nmight be weakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame clouds he created are unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:06:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't support the\Ncracked bedrock anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.72,0:07:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we must make haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lay my body to waste if\Nthat's what it takes to triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I must protect my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As the future Shogun, that\Nis the very least I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Romanosuke, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I grew up to stop this island,\Nand that's what I'm going to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course, but that won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just shove it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we've nearly reached\Nthe capital already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have mere moments to spare!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop it\Nwith your flame clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what's making it\Nfloat in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido is controlling\NOnigashima with his clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to push back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You must create more\Npowerful ones than his!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:07:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I barely even know how to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, we cannot be certain that\NI have the same abilities as Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.82,0:08:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've already made flame clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is coming to help us, and the\Nsituation is more serious than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaido's plan succeeds, there will\Nbe countless fatalities in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not the\Nworst-case scenario anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaido runs out of strength,\Nhis flame clouds will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.50,0:08:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.41,0:08:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigashima will go hurtling\Nto the ground at full speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,causing unimaginable destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But its size isn't the only problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigashima is full of gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And explosives, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be like dropping a bomb\Nthe size of a mountain on the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's too late to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're far too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't have time to evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our allies would all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And the capital would burn to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yabal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy is the only one\Ncapable of defeating Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is his only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of Wano is on\Nhis shoulders alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything to\Njeopardize his victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll finish this ourselves\Nalone without anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Thing is pissed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,King the Wildfire happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.06,0:10:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have figured, but those lead\Nperformer guys are nothing to scoff at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.90,0:10:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.12,0:10:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're down to the top guys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You need me to back you up? No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, King!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck! Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you aim in that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You just cut my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame I didn't cut your neck instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro just made a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jake, everyone knows you don't lay\Na finger on Master King's mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:10:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be lucky if we survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if anyone's ever\Nseen his face under that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.98,0:11:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.16,0:11:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword-style.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultra!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultra Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-shirt style! Clear land!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you for trying\Nto kill me without your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you doubting what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It does sound absurd, I admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So anything else in terms of the\Ndragon's origin, I do have a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,though i can't guess their identity\Nthat must be a man-made Devil Fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Vegapunk's doing it. Seems to be\Nwith Straw Hat Luffy's ally. Why is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:13:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,that a problem let the pirates\Ndestroy each other tell me why did you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Really call us. I received some new\Norders from above. A contingency plan
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,in case kaido loses the land of\Nwano currently unaffiliated with the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,world government is to be placed\Nunder our direct control effective
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,immediately they've already sent a\Nsmall fleet they will be ready soon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,seizing a country by force\Nnasty business they're hardly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,better than pirates what are\Nthe odds that Kaido doesn't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When this began, Kaido had\N30,000 troops on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's down to roughly 12,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.06,0:13:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai started with 5,400\Ntroops, but now are 8,000 strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit it's been fascinating\Nto watch this battle unfold,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but as for Kaido facing defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.20,0:13:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep me updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:14:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I received one more order. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.96,0:14:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You must bring in Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who wins tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Both pirate crews need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the key to everything for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already blown this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't screw it up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Delict.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not laying a single\Nfinger on my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Three verse humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrow notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Flash?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.56,0:14:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, how did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was aiming for stylish\Nbut simple this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I loved it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, you're not hurt,\Nare you? I'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nico Robin, straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Surround. Don't let her escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a nice crowd, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.14,0:15:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare say you're turning\Ninto quite the superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fame is such a bother. Any good advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly have experience\Nwith an overbearing fan base.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know just the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a star needs is a good bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got the best. My hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me blush and\NI don't even have skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth and be powerful, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all collapsing so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.98,0:15:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Momonosuke, new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.34,0:15:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But in case the island does fall, I\Nneed to try to minimize the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to the Skull Dome now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Down in the armory There are thousands\Nof explosives just waiting to go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to take care of them somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it doesn't come to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But at least I can stop the capital\Nfrom being completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I need guidance! You can't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make stronger flame\Nclouds than Kaido's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Curses! Curses! Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame clouds! Come forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,leave me all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it. You must!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fruitless! Bruteless!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop, stop, don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need more practice, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame clouds, come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.40,0:17:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The lives of my people are at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not fall on my\Ncapital, you wicked, wicked bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a big wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have faith in you, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame clouds, come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Vin Smoke Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good dance partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you some moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like a funk machine gun and\Nyou can't stop the beat you dig it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.12,0:19:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on you got no rhythm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.66,0:19:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,YOU GOTTA SHOW ME THE GOOD STUFF!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I WANNA SEE JERMA-DOUBLE-SIX'S\NCOMBAT SUIT NOW!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Change NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,YOU BROUGHT OUT YOUR SUIT\NWHEN YOU WERE FIGHTING KING!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,WHY IS HE SPECIAL?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,IT MADE YOU Turn INVISIBLE, RIGHT?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,THAT'S JUDGE'S HANDYWORK\NIF I 'VE EVER SEEN IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YOU REALLY KNOW HOW TO PUSH MY BUTTONS!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling weird again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wear the suit, you tease!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.02,0:19:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Fitzsmoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How thick is your head, you stupid lizard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know my family situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even think of them as family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not wearing that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get ready, Tucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Coffee Bean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Diable Jamba!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In Quake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Carol Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That kick didn't hurt at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to take something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This lizard isn't going down\Neasy. That's a pretty good
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,kick for a meat bag just to\Nbe sporting i'll show you the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,power of a dinosaur raw as\Nnature intended you're about to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Experience 100 million years\Nof evolutionary perfection!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow down, puny humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.86,0:21:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a history lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause here comes prehistoric power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Start crying, begging, cowering in fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.40,0:22:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Brachiosnakeia!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.04,0:22:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.62,0:22:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.30,0:22:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I caught you off guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what a\Nbrachiosaurus is capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.82,0:22:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.24,0:22:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your squishy human body\Nis no match for the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,raw ancient power\Ncoursing through my veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.80,0:23:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's ever escaped from\Nmy brachio-coilus technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.44,0:23:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll squeeze the life out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.44,0:23:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sangoro, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That dinosaur man is right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.52,0:23:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.78,0:23:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll crush him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.00,0:23:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The strength of dinosaurs\Ndefies all reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vi, fungeron!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a master of conquerors\NHaki could escape this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The pressure will shadow your bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,crush your internal organs, and compress\Nyour body into a human meatball.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.82,0:23:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you're judges, boy,\NI'll cut you a sweet deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.42,0:23:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me Jerma's power\Nsuit and I'll let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.74,0:23:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pete's getting\Nsqueezed to paste, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.12,0:24:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.74,0:24:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You see my torso and legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.50,0:24:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They would be totally useless right\Nnow if I was a normal brachiosaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.34,0:24:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm better than normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.50,0:24:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I equipped my useless torso\Nwith powerful weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My genius sees a problem in\Nnature and improves upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.76,0:24:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Their voice activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.58,0:24:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is call their\Nname and they'll fire on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.82,0:24:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called Brachiolongers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.16,0:24:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They fire, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.74,0:24:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just saying the\Nname conversationally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.76,0:24:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid torso!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.08,0:24:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only supposed to fire when\NI get it like a cool technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.64,0:24:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,brachio-launchers
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.42,0:24:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.08,0:25:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,my constriction
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Technique did the job.\NThe fight's over. You're
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.32,0:25:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,already dead I just came to bury you who
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.64,0:25:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Knows how many broken bones\Nhe has after all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.92,0:25:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's worse, his organs\Nare probably a mess as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.52,0:25:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Our choice is
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.94,0:25:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.85,0:25:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We must use the mink medicine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.16,0:25:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Crocodile. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.90,0:25:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.90,0:25:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it hurts, but it seems\Nlike I can walk at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.96,0:25:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaky, you didn't turn\Ninto a zombie, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.46,0:25:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.50,0:26:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to me,\Nit's really freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.94,0:26:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.06,0:26:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something trigger it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.90,0:26:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I going to end up like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.34,0:26:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.26,0:26:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay focused!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.64,0:26:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.26,0:26:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time I got\Nhit was just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.38,0:26:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish you this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.90,0:26:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.58,0:26:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.62,0:26:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.90,0:26:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to become\Na monster like them!
